{"4165990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cavemates", "steam_appid": 4165990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cavemates is a co-op multiplayer adventure, where you and your mates find something you maybe shouldn’t have. Work together, cross different biomes, each with their own challenges, and try to bring the egg back home in one piece.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All imagery is work in progress and is subject to change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The big score</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one of your strolls you and your mates discover an egg. Since stories are not as good as the real thing, bring it home in one piece to show it off back at the cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/417902bd6e565b01c89aca49154ee275.poster.avif?t=1781432560\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/417902bd6e565b01c89aca49154ee275.webm?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/417902bd6e565b01c89aca49154ee275.mp4?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The best adventures are with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your friends with you and go on this co-op adventure together with up to 3 friends and make it an experience you won't forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/0783547f3901277d912b5df5e36e16bc.poster.avif?t=1781432560\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/0783547f3901277d912b5df5e36e16bc.webm?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/0783547f3901277d912b5df5e36e16bc.mp4?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw, catch, jump.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-work makes the dream work. Throw the egg to each other in order to clear jumps and parkours but make sure not to drop it. Only so many times until you make a mess.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/09472990c81603ba546502a939783d62.poster.avif?t=1781432560\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/09472990c81603ba546502a939783d62.webm?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/09472990c81603ba546502a939783d62.mp4?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You against the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As luck has it, the way back home isn't exactly a walk in the park. Rivers, mud slides, dark caves, crocodile filled swamps and more surprises are waiting to ruin your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/9272005978231ca404333bf2c967e981.poster.avif?t=1781432560\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/9272005978231ca404333bf2c967e981.webm?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/9272005978231ca404333bf2c967e981.mp4?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you will get:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your way, avoid death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different biomes each with new unique challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cavemates is a co-op multiplayer adventure, where you and your mates find something you maybe shouldn’t have. Work together, cross different biomes, each with their own challenges, and try to bring the egg back home in one piece.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All imagery is work in progress and is subject to change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The big score</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one of your strolls you and your mates discover an egg. Since stories are not as good as the real thing, bring it home in one piece to show it off back at the cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/417902bd6e565b01c89aca49154ee275.poster.avif?t=1781432560\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/417902bd6e565b01c89aca49154ee275.webm?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/417902bd6e565b01c89aca49154ee275.mp4?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The best adventures are with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your friends with you and go on this co-op adventure together with up to 3 friends and make it an experience you won't forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/0783547f3901277d912b5df5e36e16bc.poster.avif?t=1781432560\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/0783547f3901277d912b5df5e36e16bc.webm?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/0783547f3901277d912b5df5e36e16bc.mp4?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw, catch, jump.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-work makes the dream work. Throw the egg to each other in order to clear jumps and parkours but make sure not to drop it. Only so many times until you make a mess.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/09472990c81603ba546502a939783d62.poster.avif?t=1781432560\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/09472990c81603ba546502a939783d62.webm?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/09472990c81603ba546502a939783d62.mp4?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You against the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As luck has it, the way back home isn't exactly a walk in the park. Rivers, mud slides, dark caves, crocodile filled swamps and more surprises are waiting to ruin your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/9272005978231ca404333bf2c967e981.poster.avif?t=1781432560\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/9272005978231ca404333bf2c967e981.webm?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/extras/9272005978231ca404333bf2c967e981.mp4?t=1781432560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you will get:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your way, avoid death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different biomes each with new unique challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Cavemates is a co-op multiplayer adventure, where you and your mates find something you maybe shouldn’t have. Work together, cross different biomes, each with their own challenges, and try to bring the egg back home in one piece.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/ddbcdb50b836f5dba516c7ec86e370e785f94117/header.jpg?t=1781432560", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/d0f4cbaa6add920a6db65cf2637b476b15c09b32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781432560", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165990/d0f4cbaa6add920a6db65c